Board-only suite: the compiler change it covers exists only in the STM32-L476RG_raw emitter (memory spaces normal, normal_writeback, atomic are provided; normal_writethrough, normal_noncacheable and device are refused), and the goldens are STM32-L476RG_raw ones, so the host integrate run skips this directory and the ESP32-S3_raw board run skips it too (ESP32-S3_raw.skip). Run it with make integrate TRIAL_TARGET=STM32-L476RG_raw TRIAL_SUITES=memory_space_nucleo_addition from trials/. Remove this file only if a host-side skip mechanism replaces it.
